# Iris Multiclass Classification

This project focuses on classifying Iris flower species using machine learning.

## Project Overview

The dataset contains different features of Iris flowers, including sepal and petal measurements. The goal is to predict the species of each flower.

## Workflow

- Data loading and inspection
- Data preprocessing
- Exploratory data analysis using pair plots
- Training and testing data splitting
- Feature scaling
- Model training and comparison

## Models Used

- Logistic Regression
- Decision Tree Classifier

## Evaluation

The models are evaluated using:

- Accuracy
- Precision
- Recall
- F1-Score
- Classification Report
- Confusion Matrix

A decision boundary visualization is also included to understand the classification performance using selected features.

## Libraries Used

- NumPy
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
